WEBVTT

00:07:29.230 --> 00:07:31.563
Leather seats -- 2,000 euros extra.

00:07:31.563 --> 00:07:32.797
You get the picture.

00:07:32.830 --> 00:07:34.230
So let's imagine:

00:07:34.230 --> 00:07:38.997
that same discussion we had earlier,
but with a car producer in the middle,

00:07:39.030 --> 00:07:40.563
where the activist says,

00:07:40.597 --> 00:07:43.663
"Your emissions are harming the planet
and threatening humanity.

00:07:43.663 --> 00:07:45.497
You need to change immediately."

00:07:45.530 --> 00:07:47.630
And now a car producer answers,

00:07:47.630 --> 00:07:48.797
"I know.

00:07:48.830 --> 00:07:52.697
But if I invest in low-carbon materials,
and the next guy doesn't,

00:07:52.697 --> 00:07:55.330
my car will be two percent more expensive.

00:07:55.763 --> 00:07:56.930
Wait ...

00:07:56.963 --> 00:07:59.063
My customers might actually pay that.

00:07:59.363 --> 00:08:01.730
And I can market all my cars
as carbon-neutral.